      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"ClassPathFileSystemWatcher.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.devtools.classpath\"><code>ClassPathFileSystemWatcher</code></a> instance.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的<a href=\"ClassPathFileSystemWatcher.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.devtools.classpath\"><code>ClassPathFileSystemWatcher</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Set if the <a href=\"../filewatch/FileSystemWatcher.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.devtools.filewatch\"><code>FileSystemWatcher</code></a> should be stopped when a full restart occurs.",
      "translation": "设置是否在完全重启时停止<a href=\"../filewatch/FileSystemWatcher.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.devtools.filewatch\"><code>FileSystemWatcher</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Encapsulates a <a href=\"../filewatch/FileSystemWatcher.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.devtools.filewatch\"><code>FileSystemWatcher</code></a> to watch the local classpath directories for\nchanges.",
      "translation": "封装一个 `<a href=\"../filewatch/FileSystemWatcher.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.devtools.filewatch\"><code>FileSystemWatcher</code></a>` 以监视本地类路径目录中的更改。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>fileSystemWatcherFactory</code> - a factory to create the underlying\n<a href=\"../filewatch/FileSystemWatcher.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.devtools.filewatch\"><code>FileSystemWatcher</code></a> used to monitor the local file system",
      "translation": "<code>fileSystemWatcherFactory</code> - 一个用于创建底层 <a href=\"../filewatch/FileSystemWatcher.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.devtools.filewatch\"><code>FileSystemWatcher</code></a> 的工厂，该工厂用于监控本地文件系统。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>restartStrategy</code> - the classpath restart strategy",
      "translation": "<code>restartStrategy</code> - 类路径重启策略",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>urls</code> - the URLs to watch",
      "translation": "<code>urls</code> - 要监视的 URL",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>stopWatcherOnRestart</code> - if the watcher should be stopped when a restart occurs",
      "translation": "<code>stopWatcherOnRestart</code> - 如果发生重启时应停止监视器",
      "count": 2
    },
